---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Secrets for agents: sandboxes see placeholders, smolvm sends the real value

Usage: bento secret [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  set         Set a secret for a built-in service (anthropic, claude, github, openai, …)
  set-custom  Set a secret for any host and environment variable
  ls          List secrets (never values) [alias: list]
  rm          Remove secrets [aliases: remove, delete, unset]
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
